OL,3,GNEWSAHull City footballer in crash near
OL,4,Atraining ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FPremier League winger Sorba Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen involved in a car crash close to
OL,8,FHull City's training ground, the club
OL,9,Fhas confirmed.
OL,11,FThe 27-year-old walked away from the
OL,12,Fcrash, which happened on Millhouse
OL,13,FWoods Lane in Cottingham on Friday
OL,14,Fmorning. His vehicle, a grey Land Rover
OL,15,FDefender, was pictured on its roof,
OL,16,Fwith broken windows.
OL,18,FHumberside Police said emergency
OL,19,Fservices remained at the scene and
OL,20,Fasked people to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
