OL,3,GNEWSAHull City footballer in crash near
OL,4,Atraining ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the club said it was
OL,7,F"relieved" to hear its player, who
OL,8,Fjoined the Tigers from Championship
OL,9,Fside Stoke City earlier this month, was
OL,10,Funharmed.
